        <mxCell id="9WVEo1uETbsfiN-eSXl2-14" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=17;spacing=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=left;" value="&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; User → interface: master password, login request, and password-management actions (view, add, edit, delete).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; Interface → user management: authentication request, action, and when adding/editing - temporary plaintext credential data.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; User management → encryption: after successful authentication, send the derived key, encryption request, and credential data that must be encrypted.&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt; Encryption → storage:&amp;nbsp;save the encrypted package: salt, KDF parameters, nonce, ciphertext, and authentication tag.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt; Storage → encryption: encrypted credential/vault data requested by the user&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt; Encryption → user management: verified and decrypted vault in memory.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.&lt;/b&gt; User management → interface: requested result or error.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.&lt;/b&gt; Interface → user: display result. Plaintext data is not written to storage.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="1220" x="640" y="700" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
